AUDIO: 'that each of these agents had their own special tasks that they executed and bounced ideas back and forth landing on something that was output by the one agent here in the corner. Something that I noticed in running this test is that GLM 5.1 is significantly slower than the other ones. So, it was actually like a'

[07:35] [scene:talk]
